WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Christians still pray
the words Jesus taught:

2
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.140
May your Kingdom come.

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:10.290
Yet in the same Gospel, Jesus says:
God's Kingdom has come to you.

4
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.030
His stories about the
Kingdom are full of seeds,

5
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.280
harvests and feasts.

6
00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.850
So did Jesus think God's
Kingdom had already arrived,

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.690
or was it still to come?

8
00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:24.310
In this mission, you'll find out
what the Kingdom of God meant:

9
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.830
a reign, more than a place.

10
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.060
Then you'll read 2 of his stories,
the Sower and the Great Banquet,

11
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.470
and sort his sayings on a timeline.

12
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.190
Your mission: weigh up whether Jesus
thought God's Kingdom had already arrived,

13
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.470
or was still to come.
